---
const heroBase = "/images/moru";
---

<section
  class="mt-[var(--space-section-y)]"
  aria-labelledby="home-hero-heading"
>
  <div
    class="grid items-center gap-8 md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,1.1fr)] md:gap-10"
  >
    <div
      class="media-frame mx-auto w-full max-w-sm overflow-hidden rounded-xl md:mx-0 md:max-w-none"
      aria-hidden="true"
    >
      <picture>
        <source
          type="image/webp"
          srcset={`${heroBase}/hero-400.webp 400w, ${heroBase}/hero-768.webp 768w, ${heroBase}/hero-1280.webp 1280w`}
          sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 42vw"
        />
        <img
          src={`${heroBase}/hero.webp`}
          alt=""
          width={1280}
          height={1536}
          loading="eager"
          fetchpriority="high"
          decoding="async"
          class="h-auto w-full object-contain"
        />
      </picture>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h1 id="home-hero-heading" class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">
        개발 노트
      </h1>
      <p class="text-muted mt-3 text-lg leading-relaxed">
        “왜 그럴까?”를 같이 파고듭니다. 궁금한 것을 기록하고, 천천히 이해해
        나갑니다.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4">
        <a
          href="/notes"
          class="text-sm font-medium text-[var(--accent)] underline underline-offset-2 transition-opacity hover:opacity-80"
        >
          전체 노트 보기 →
        </a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
